#AREA King Menos' Maze~
#AUTHORS Presto ~





#HELPS
-1 KINGMENOSMAZE~
The maze is the final episode in the Isle of Mist trilogy, which consists
of The Isle of Mist, Mist City, and King Menos' Maze.  This maze is taken
from Greek legend.  Inside the maze you can find giant rats, gelatinus
cubes, athenian men and women sentenced to their deaths, Theseus, the famed 
slayer of the minotaur, and of course .. the minotaur.  Recalling is not an 
option from within the maze.  MUHAHAHA

  (-) Back

{-}PRESTO
~
0 $~




#RANGES 75 95 60 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#11200
minotaur~
The Minotaur~
The Minotaur is here!  Prepare to die!~
This is the most powerful being on the isle.  Kiss your ass goodbye!
~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_HUNT|AFF_TONGUES
-1000 S
95 BODY_MOUTH|BODY_CLAW BODY_MOUTH|BODY_CLAW 0d0+15000 10d10+50
329122 780605
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_NEUTRAL
>all_greet_prog 100~
mpforce all external GROWL03.WAV
stand
shout RRRRRRRRRROOOOOOOOOOAAAAAAAAAARRRRRRRRRR!!!!!!!!!!
mpkill $n
~
>entry_prog 100~
shout RRRRRRRRRROOOOOOOOOOAAAAAAAAAARRRRRRRRRR!!!!!!!!!!
mpkill $r
~
>fight_prog 10~
if rand(20)
  emote charges at you!
else
  growl $r
endif
~
>rand_prog 25~
mpkill athenian
mpkill theseus
~
>death_prog 99~
if rand(75)
  mpoload 11201 80
else
endif
if rand(75)
  mpoload 11202 75
else
endif
if rand(75)
  mpoload 11206 55
else
endif
if rand(10)
  mpoload 11200 85
else
endif
if rand(10)
  mpoload 11204 70
else
endif
if rand(10)
  mpoload 11205 75
endif
~
>rand_prog 2~
stand 
~
|
#11201
theseus~
Theseus~
Theseus is here, looking for the minotaur.~
This is Theseus, the famed hero who ventured into King Menos' maze and
slew the minotaur, so you thought.  If he's still here, then perhaps
the minotaur is as well.~
ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_STEALTH
1000 S
85 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 0d0+10000 5d5+55
277964 646617
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
mpforce $n external FOOLISH.WAV
~
>death_prog 99~
if rand(75)
  mpoload 11200 85
else
  if rand(50)
    mpoload 11202 75
  else
    if rand(50)
      mpoload 11204 70
    endif
  endif
endif
if actorhasobjnum(30900)
or actorhasobjnum(30966)
or actorhasobjnum(30967)
or actorhasobjnum(30968)
or actorhasobjnum(30969)
  if quest(30,1,$n) == 0
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
    mpoload 30914
    mpforce $n HELP GUILDTOKEN
    mpquiet on
    c 'giant strength' $n
    give i30914 $n
    mpquiet off
    mpforce $n external YIPEE.WAV
  endif
endif~
|
#11202
athenian~
A young Athenian~
A young Athenian woman is here, trapped in the labyrinth.~
She is young, and quite beautiful.  You wonder what possessed Menos to
send such a beautiful woman to her doom.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_PROTECT_EVIL|AFF_TONGUES
250 S
75 BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT 20d300+350 9d7+30
0 525271
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>rand_prog 30~
mpechoaround $n The athenian mistakes $r for the minotaur and attacks!
mpechoat $n The athenian mistakes you for the minotaur and attacks!
mpkill $r
~
>death_prog 99~
mpforce all external REGRET.WAV
if rand(3)
  mpoload 11200
else
  if rand(3)
    mpoload 11201
  else
    if rand(3)
      mpoload 11202
    else
      if rand(3)
        mpoload 11204
      else
        if rand(5)
          mpoload 11205
        else
          if rand(3)
            mpoload 11206
          else
            mpoload 11207
          endif
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
